,"title":"Reading · A short report","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Report: Why the Library Closed","paras":["The library, **whose** budget was cut, closed last month. **If the council had invested**, it **would still be** open. Managers **account for** the decision by pointing to falling visits, **a decline that** analysts **single out** as the key factor. The service, **most of whose** users were students, **would have survived had** it moved online. **On balance**, the explanation is fair, **although** it fails to **account for** the role of rising rents."],"kicker":"REPORT","by":"Local Desk","gloss":[["budget","orçamento"],["visit","visita"],["survive","sobreviver"],["user","usuário"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The library is still open.","ans":"F","why":"closed last month."},{"q":"Managers point to falling visits.","ans":"T","why":"falling visits."},{"q":"The report mentions rising rents.","ans":"F","why":"fails to account."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“budget” = ?","opts":["orçamento","buda","bote"],"ans":0,"why":"budget = orçamento."},{"q":"“survive” = ?","opts":["sobreviver","servir","resolver"],"ans":0,"why":"survive = sobreviver."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Tópico","Lembrete"],"rows":[["Mixed conditionals","**If the council had invested, it would still be open.**"],["Relative clauses","**whose**, **most of whose**, **in which**"],["account for","**accounts for** / **failed to account for**"],["single out","**single out** the key factor"],["Inversion","**Had it moved online, it would have survived.**"]],"cap":"Unidade 9: o que lembrar"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The heating ___ on the second night. (fail)","a":"failed","why":"passado."},{"s":"If we ___ acted earl