rita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-sentence analysis of a closure, using two structures from the unit.","model":"The cinema, whose roof leaked for years, closed last week. If the owner had repaired it, the cinema would still be open. Managers account for the closure by pointing to falling sales. Analysts single out streaming as the key factor. Had the town supported it, it might have survived. On balance, the explanation is fair, although incomplete.","checklist":["Usei **whose**","Usei **condicional mista**","Usei **account for / single out**"],"words":"6 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Spaced practice · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “hotel stay” mean?","opts":["estadia em hotel","registro de tom","bolsa-piloto"],"ans":0,"why":"**hotel stay** = estadia em hotel."},{"q":"What does “tone register” mean?","opts":["clima da opinião pública","registro de tom","valor impossível"],"ans":1,"why":"**tone register** = registro de tom."},{"q":"What does “public mood” mean?","opts":["bolsa-piloto","estadia em hotel","clima da opinião pública"],"ans":2,"why":"**public mood** = clima da opinião pública."},{"q":"What does “pilot grant” mean?","opts":["bolsa-piloto","valor impossível","registro de tom"],"ans":0,"why":"**pilot grant** = bolsa-piloto."},{"q":"What does “impossible value” mean?","opts":["estadia em hotel","valor impossível","clima da opinião pública"],"ans":1,"why":"**impossible value** = valor impossível."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Plano de revisão espaçada","body":["**Hoje:** refaça os quadros 6 e 7.","**Em 3 dias:** diga as frases do quadro 10 sem olhar.","**Em 7 dias:** escreva de memória o texto do quadro 11.","No IELTS Writing Task 2, relativas e condicionais variadas demonstram alcance gramatical."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Reveja condicionais mistas com linhas do tempo.","Peça relativas com preposição + which/whom.","Corrija em pares com a lista de verificação."]}]}]}